  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Mbenyamini asyaa Mbela ĩkithathi yake, na wa kelĩ Asiveli, na wa katatũ Aiala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.26.38+NUM.26.39+NUM.26.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mot 26.38–40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.7.6+1CH.7.7+1CH.7.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Mav 7.6–8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na wa kana Noia, na wa katano Lavia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Mbela aĩ na ana: Atali, na Ngela, na Aviiuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Avisua, na Naamani, na Aoa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Ngela, na Suvamu, na Ulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aa nĩo ana ma Euti; aa nĩo atongoi ma nyũmba sya aaĩthe ma ala matwĩe Ngeva, na mamatwaa ku Manaathi me atave: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Naamani na Aiya, na Ngela, amatwaa me atave; nake asyaa Usa na Aiuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Saalaimi asyaĩa syana weũnĩ wa Moavi ĩtina wa kũlũngya Usimu na Vaala iveti syake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Otesi mũka wake asyaa Yovavu, na Nzivia, na Mesa, na Malikamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Yeusi, na Sakia, na Milima. Asu nĩ ana make, atongoi ma nyũmba sya aaĩthe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Usimu asyaa Avituvu na Elivaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ana ma Elivaali: Eveli, na Misamu, na Semeti, ũla waakie Ono na Loti, na tũtũla twasyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Mbelia, na Sema, ala maĩ atongoi ma nyũmba sya aaĩthe ma ala matwĩe Aiyaloni, ala malũngilye ala matwĩe Ngathi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Aio, na Sasaki, na Yelemothi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Nzevatia, na Alati, na Eteli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Mikaeli, na Isiiva, na Yooa, ana ma Mbelia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Nzevatia, na Mesulamu, na Isiki, na Eeveli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Isimelai, na Isilia, na Yovavu, ana ma Elivaali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Yakimu, na Nzikili, na Nzaveti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Elienai, na Nzilethai, na Elieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Ataia, na Similathi, ana ma Simei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Isivani, na Eeveli, na Elieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Avitoni, na Nzikili, na Aananu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Aanania, na Elamu, na Anithothiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Iveteia, na Venaeli, ana ma Sasaki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Samuselai, na Seaalia, na Athalia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Yaalesia, na Eliya, na Nzikili, ana ma Yeloamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asu maĩ atongoi ma nyũmba sya aaĩthe nzyawanĩ syoo syonthe, andũ anene: nao matwĩe Yelusaleme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiveoni kwatwĩe Yeieli ĩthe wa Ngiveoni, ũla syĩtwa ya kĩveti kyake kyeetawa Maaka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.9.35+1CH.9.36+1CH.9.37+1CH.9.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Mav 9.35–38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ĩkithathi yake nĩ Avitoni, na ĩndĩ Nzuli, na Kisu, na Mbaali, na Natavu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Ngetoli, na Aio, na Nzekeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Mikilothi asyaa Simea. Nao matũaa na ana‐a‐ĩthe moo Yelusaleme, melekanĩle ana‐a‐ĩthe moo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Neli asyaa Kisu; na Kisu asyaa Saulo; na Saulo asyaa Yonathani, na Malikisuua, na Avinatavu, na Esi‐mbaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.9.39+1CH.9.40+1CH.9.41+1CH.9.42+1CH.9.43+1CH.9.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Mav 9.39–44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
